#| msgid "Entering a new event is very easy. Just choose the <menuchoice><guimenu>Actions</guimenu><guimenuitem>New Event...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item. A window with <guilabel>General</guilabel>, <guilabel>Recurrence</guilabel>, <guilabel>Attendees</guilabel>, <guilabel>Free/Busy</guilabel>, and <guilabel>Attachments</guilabel> tabs will appear."
