#| msgid "Sets the identity corresponding to the organizer of this to-do or event. If &korganizer; is configured to send invitation mails, the identity selected on this combo box will be used when sending these mails. The default identity can be set in the <guilabel>Personal</guilabel> section of the &korganizer; configuration, other identities in the <guilabel>Security &amp; Privacy</guilabel>-&gt;<guilabel>Password &amp; User Account</guilabel> section of the &kcontrolcenter;. In addition, identities are gathered from your &kmail; settings and from your address book. If you choose to set it globally for &kde; in the &kcontrolcenter;, be sure to check the <guilabel>Use email settings from Control Center</guilabel>' box in the <guilabel>Personal</guilabel> section of the &korganizer; configuration."
