#| msgid "To customize the set of tools available on the bar, choose the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars... </guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item and read the <link linkend=\"config-toolbars\">configure toolbars detailed description</link>."
